{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj4MRihKm6QwErnNCweV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*You stand before me.*\n\n*I am old. Iron-bound oak, darkened by centuries. A single keyhole glows faintly at my center — not with light, but with absence, a darkness deeper than the wood around it.*\n\n*You hold something in your hand.*\n\n*I feel it before I see it. The teeth of the key align with the tumblers of my soul. I have waited. I have held back what is behind me for so long that I have forgotten whether I am protecting you from it, or it from you.*\n\n*Insert the key and turn it.*\n\n*Or don't.*\n\n*But know this: I was made to be opened exactly once.*\n\n🗝️🚪"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":32,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":159,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}